{"cantica":"inferno","cantoNumber":3,"title":"Canto III","totalDuration":371.52,"segments":[{"id":1,"speaker":"gate_inscription","text":"Through me lies the path to the city of suffering;\nThrough me lies the path to eternal sorrow;\nThrough me lies the path among the lost souls.\nJustice moved my sublime Creator to make me;\nDivine power shaped me,\nThe highest Wisdom and primordial Love.\nBefore me, nothing was created\nExcept eternal things, and I endure forever.\nAbandon all hope, you who enter here!","startTime":0,"endTime":33.52,"words":[{"word":"Through","start":0,"end":0.32},{"word":"me","start":0.32,"end":0.8},{"word":"lies","start":0.8,"end":1.2},{"word":"the","start":1.2,"end":1.36},{"word":"path","start":1.36,"end":1.84},{"word":"to","start":1.84,"end":2},{"word":"the","start":2,"end":2.24},{"word":"city","start":2.24,"end":2.6},{"word":"of","start":2.6,"end":2.88},{"word":"suffering;","start":2.88,"end":4.08},{"word":"Through","start":4.08,"end":4.48},{"word":"me","start":4.48,"end":4.96},{"word":"lies","start":4.96,"end":5.36},{"word":"the","start":5.36,"end":5.64},{"word":"path","start":5.64,"end":5.92},{"word":"to","start":5.92,"end":6.08},{"word":"eternal","start":6.08,"end":6.88},{"word":"sorrow;","start":6.88,"end":8},{"word":"Through","start":8,"end":8.4},{"word":"me","start":8.4,"end":8.96},{"word":"lies","start":8.96,"end":9.36},{"word":"the","start":9.36,"end":9.52},{"word":"path","start":9.52,"end":10},{"word":"among","start":10,"end":10.4},{"word":"the","start":10.4,"end":10.56},{"word":"lost","start":10.56,"end":11.12},{"word":"souls.","start":11.12,"end":12.96},{"word":"Justice","start":12.96,"end":13.52},{"word":"moved","start":13.52,"end":13.76},{"word":"my","start":13.76,"end":14},{"word":"sublime","start":14,"end":15.04},{"word":"Creator","start":15.04,"end":15.28},{"word":"to","start":15.28,"end":15.6},{"word":"make","start":15.6,"end":15.92},{"word":"me;","start":15.92,"end":16.64},{"word":"Divine","start":16.64,"end":17.6},{"word":"power","start":17.6,"end":17.84},{"word":"shaped","start":17.84,"end":18.48},{"word":"me,","start":18.48,"end":19.04},{"word":"The","start":19.04,"end":19.6},{"word":"highest","start":19.6,"end":19.92},{"word":"Wisdom","start":19.92,"end":20.48},{"word":"and","start":20.48,"end":20.96},{"word":"primordial","start":20.96,"end":22},{"word":"Love.","start":22,"end":22.96},{"word":"Before","start":22.96,"end":23.28},{"word":"me,","start":23.28,"end":24.08},{"word":"nothing","start":24.08,"end":24.32},{"word":"was","start":24.32,"end":24.96},{"word":"created","start":24.96,"end":25.68},{"word":"Except","start":25.68,"end":26},{"word":"eternal","start":26,"end":26.96},{"word":"things,","start":26.96,"end":27.52},{"word":"and","start":27.52,"end":28},{"word":"I","start":28,"end":28.4},{"word":"endure","start":28.4,"end":29.2},{"word":"forever.","start":29.2,"end":30.32},{"word":"Abandon","start":30.32,"end":31.12},{"word":"all","start":31.12,"end":31.6},{"word":"hope,","start":31.6,"end":32.16},{"word":"you","start":32.16,"end":32.32},{"word":"who","start":32.32,"end":32.72},{"word":"enter","start":32.72,"end":33.28},{"word":"here!","start":33.28,"end":33.52}]},{"id":2,"speaker":"narrator","text":"These words, written in dark lettering,\nI saw inscribed above a gate.","startTime":33.52,"endTime":38.64,"words":[{"word":"These","start":33.76,"end":34.08},{"word":"words,","start":34.08,"end":34.88},{"word":"written","start":34.88,"end":35.32},{"word":"in","start":35.32,"end":35.52},{"word":"dark","start":35.52,"end":35.84},{"word":"lettering,","start":35.84,"end":36.72},{"word":"I","start":36.72,"end":36.92},{"word":"saw","start":36.92,"end":37.12},{"word":"inscribed","start":37.12,"end":37.88},{"word":"above","start":37.88,"end":38.04},{"word":"a","start":38.04,"end":38.16},{"word":"gate.","start":38.16,"end":38.64}]},{"id":3,"speaker":"dante","text":"Master,\" I said, \"their meaning troubles me.","startTime":38.64,"endTime":42.4,"words":[{"word":"Master,\"","start":38.8,"end":39.76},{"word":"I","start":39.76,"end":39.96},{"word":"said,","start":39.96,"end":40.64},{"word":"\"their","start":40.64,"end":41.16},{"word":"meaning","start":41.16,"end":41.44},{"word":"troubles","start":41.44,"end":41.92},{"word":"me.","start":41.92,"end":42.4}]},{"id":4,"speaker":"narrator","text":"And he answered, like one who understands:","startTime":42.4,"endTime":45.6,"words":[{"word":"And","start":42.481,"end":42.721},{"word":"he","start":42.721,"end":42.881},{"word":"answered,","start":42.881,"end":43.921},{"word":"like","start":43.921,"end":44.161},{"word":"one","start":44.161,"end":44.401},{"word":"who","start":44.401,"end":44.561},{"word":"understands:","start":44.561,"end":45.6}]},{"id":5,"speaker":"virgil","text":"Here you must leave behind all hesitation,\nHere cowardice must die within you.\nWe have reached the place I told you of,\nWhere you will see the wretched people\nWho have lost the good of reason.","startTime":45.6,"endTime":59.04,"words":[{"word":"Here","start":45.6,"end":45.92},{"word":"you","start":45.92,"end":46.08},{"word":"must","start":46.08,"end":46.32},{"word":"leave","start":46.32,"end":46.64},{"word":"behind","start":46.64,"end":47.2},{"word":"all","start":47.2,"end":47.6},{"word":"hesitation,","start":47.6,"end":49.12},{"word":"Here","start":49.12,"end":49.68},{"word":"cowardice","start":49.68,"end":50.32},{"word":"must","start":50.32,"end":50.72},{"word":"die","start":50.72,"end":51.04},{"word":"within","start":51.04,"end":51.44},{"word":"you.","start":51.44,"end":52.32},{"word":"We","start":52.32,"end":52.48},{"word":"have","start":52.48,"end":52.64},{"word":"reached","start":52.64,"end":53},{"word":"the","start":53,"end":53.12},{"word":"place","start":53.12,"end":53.48},{"word":"I","start":53.48,"end":53.68},{"word":"told","start":53.68,"end":54},{"word":"you","start":54,"end":54.16},{"word":"of,","start":54.16,"end":54.8},{"word":"Where","start":54.8,"end":54.96},{"word":"you","start":54.96,"end":55.12},{"word":"will","start":55.12,"end":55.36},{"word":"see","start":55.36,"end":55.6},{"word":"the","start":55.6,"end":55.84},{"word":"wretched","start":55.84,"end":56.32},{"word":"people","start":56.32,"end":56.8},{"word":"Who","start":56.8,"end":56.96},{"word":"have","start":56.96,"end":57.2},{"word":"lost","start":57.2,"end":57.64},{"word":"the","start":57.64,"end":57.84},{"word":"good","start":57.84,"end":58.16},{"word":"of","start":58.16,"end":58.32},{"word":"reason.","start":58.32,"end":59.04}]},{"id":6,"speaker":"narrator","text":"After he placed his hand on mine\nWith such a joyful expression that I felt comforted,\nHe led me into the secret realm.\nHere sighs, lamentations, and piercing screams\nEchoed through the starless air,\nSo that at first I wept to hear them.\nDiverse languages, horrible pronunciations,\nWords of pain, accents of anger,\nHigh voices and hoarse ones, the sound of striking hands—\nAll this made a tumult that swirls on\nForever in that timeless black air,\nLike sand spinning in a whirlwind.\nAnd I, my head wrapped in horror, said:","startTime":59.04,"endTime":95.12,"words":[{"word":"After","start":59.2,"end":59.52},{"word":"he","start":59.52,"end":59.84},{"word":"placed","start":59.84,"end":60.08},{"word":"his","start":60.08,"end":60.24},{"word":"hand","start":60.24,"end":60.56},{"word":"on","start":60.56,"end":60.72},{"word":"mine","start":60.72,"end":61.16},{"word":"With","start":61.16,"end":61.36},{"word":"such","start":61.36,"end":61.68},{"word":"a","start":61.68,"end":61.76},{"word":"joyful","start":61.76,"end":62.48},{"word":"expression","start":62.48,"end":62.84},{"word":"that","start":62.84,"end":63.04},{"word":"I","start":63.04,"end":63.12},{"word":"felt","start":63.12,"end":63.56},{"word":"comforted,","start":63.56,"end":64.48},{"word":"He","start":64.48,"end":64.76},{"word":"led","start":64.76,"end":65},{"word":"me","start":65,"end":65.24},{"word":"into","start":65.24,"end":65.44},{"word":"the","start":65.44,"end":65.6},{"word":"secret","start":65.6,"end":66},{"word":"realm.","start":66,"end":67.2},{"word":"Here","start":67.2,"end":67.92},{"word":"sighs,","start":67.92,"end":68.64},{"word":"lamentations,","start":68.64,"end":69.68},{"word":"and","start":69.68,"end":69.84},{"word":"piercing","start":69.84,"end":70.4},{"word":"screams","start":70.4,"end":71.04},{"word":"Echoed","start":71.04,"end":71.44},{"word":"through","start":71.44,"end":71.6},{"word":"the","start":71.6,"end":71.84},{"word":"starless","start":71.84,"end":72.32},{"word":"air,","start":72.32,"end":72.987},{"word":"So","start":72.987,"end":73.08},{"word":"that","start":73.08,"end":73.2},{"word":"at","start":73.2,"end":73.36},{"word":"first","start":73.36,"end":73.92},{"word":"I","start":73.92,"end":73.973},{"word":"wept","start":73.973,"end":74.32},{"word":"to","start":74.32,"end":74.48},{"word":"hear","start":74.48,"end":74.72},{"word":"them.","start":74.72,"end":75.48},{"word":"Diverse","start":75.48,"end":76},{"word":"languages,","start":76,"end":76.92},{"word":"horrible","start":76.92,"end":77.36},{"word":"pronunciations,","start":77.36,"end":78.6},{"word":"Words","start":78.6,"end":78.8},{"word":"of","start":78.8,"end":79.04},{"word":"pain,","start":79.04,"end":79.72},{"word":"accents","start":79.72,"end":80.16},{"word":"of","start":80.16,"end":80.32},{"word":"anger,","start":80.32,"end":81.08},{"word":"High","start":81.08,"end":81.28},{"word":"voices","start":81.28,"end":81.84},{"word":"and","start":81.84,"end":82},{"word":"hoarse","start":82,"end":82.32},{"word":"ones,","start":82.32,"end":82.88},{"word":"the","start":82.88,"end":83.12},{"word":"sound","start":83.12,"end":83.36},{"word":"of","start":83.36,"end":83.56},{"word":"striking","start":83.56,"end":84.16},{"word":"hands—","start":84.16,"end":85},{"word":"All","start":85,"end":85.2},{"word":"this","start":85.2,"end":85.52},{"word":"made","start":85.52,"end":85.68},{"word":"a","start":85.68,"end":85.8},{"word":"tumult","start":85.8,"end":86.36},{"word":"that","start":86.36,"end":86.56},{"word":"swirls","start":86.56,"end":87.04},{"word":"on","start":87.04,"end":87.52},{"word":"Forever","start":87.52,"end":87.8},{"word":"in","start":87.8,"end":87.92},{"word":"that","start":87.92,"end":88.32},{"word":"timeless","start":88.32,"end":88.72},{"word":"black","start":88.72,"end":89.12},{"word":"air,","start":89.12,"end":89.76},{"word":"Like","start":89.76,"end":90.2},{"word":"sand","start":90.2,"end":90.56},{"word":"spinning","start":90.56,"end":90.96},{"word":"in","start":90.96,"end":91.04},{"word":"a","start":91.04,"end":91.16},{"word":"whirlwind.","start":91.16,"end":92.32},{"word":"And","start":92.32,"end":92.64},{"word":"I,","start":92.64,"end":93.16},{"word":"my","start":93.16,"end":93.4},{"word":"head","start":93.4,"end":93.68},{"word":"wrapped","start":93.68,"end":94},{"word":"in","start":94,"end":94.16},{"word":"horror,","start":94.16,"end":94.76},{"word":"said:","start":94.76,"end":95.12}]},{"id":7,"speaker":"dante","text":"Master, what is this I'm hearing?\nWhat people are these, so conquered by pain?","startTime":95.12,"endTime":100.72,"words":[{"word":"Master,","start":95.28,"end":96.16},{"word":"what","start":96.16,"end":96.32},{"word":"is","start":96.32,"end":96.48},{"word":"this","start":96.48,"end":96.68},{"word":"I'm","start":96.68,"end":96.92},{"word":"hearing?","start":96.92,"end":97.84},{"word":"What","start":97.84,"end":98.08},{"word":"people","start":98.08,"end":98.48},{"word":"are","start":98.48,"end":98.64},{"word":"these,","start":98.64,"end":99.2},{"word":"so","start":99.2,"end":99.52},{"word":"conquered","start":99.52,"end":100.04},{"word":"by","start":100.04,"end":100.36},{"word":"pain?","start":100.36,"end":100.72}]},{"id":8,"speaker":"narrator","text":"He answered:","startTime":100.72,"endTime":101.84,"words":[{"word":"He","start":100.801,"end":101.241},{"word":"answered:","start":101.241,"end":101.84}]},{"id":9,"speaker":"virgil","text":"This is the miserable way\nOf those sorry souls who lived\nWithout disgrace and without praise.\nThey are mixed with that cowardly choir\nOf angels who were neither rebellious\nNor faithful to God, but served only themselves.\nHeaven cast them out to preserve its beauty;\nThe depths of Hell won't receive them either,\nFor even the damned would gain glory over them.","startTime":101.84,"endTime":127.92,"words":[{"word":"This","start":101.84,"end":102.24},{"word":"is","start":102.24,"end":102.48},{"word":"the","start":102.48,"end":102.64},{"word":"miserable","start":102.64,"end":103.44},{"word":"way","start":103.44,"end":103.76},{"word":"Of","start":103.76,"end":103.92},{"word":"those","start":103.92,"end":104.32},{"word":"sorry","start":104.32,"end":104.8},{"word":"souls","start":104.8,"end":105.6},{"word":"who","start":105.6,"end":105.84},{"word":"lived","start":105.84,"end":106.16},{"word":"Without","start":106.16,"end":106.56},{"word":"disgrace","start":106.56,"end":107.52},{"word":"and","start":107.52,"end":107.68},{"word":"without","start":107.68,"end":108.08},{"word":"praise.","start":108.08,"end":109.36},{"word":"They","start":109.36,"end":109.6},{"word":"are","start":109.6,"end":109.76},{"word":"mixed","start":109.76,"end":110.16},{"word":"with","start":110.16,"end":110.36},{"word":"that","start":110.36,"end":110.64},{"word":"cowardly","start":110.64,"end":111.2},{"word":"choir","start":111.2,"end":111.72},{"word":"Of","start":111.72,"end":111.92},{"word":"angels","start":111.92,"end":112.8},{"word":"who","start":112.8,"end":113.04},{"word":"were","start":113.04,"end":113.16},{"word":"neither","start":113.16,"end":113.44},{"word":"rebellious","start":113.44,"end":114.4},{"word":"Nor","start":114.4,"end":114.72},{"word":"faithful","start":114.72,"end":115.2},{"word":"to","start":115.2,"end":115.36},{"word":"God,","start":115.36,"end":116.16},{"word":"but","start":116.16,"end":116.32},{"word":"served","start":116.32,"end":116.8},{"word":"only","start":116.8,"end":117.12},{"word":"themselves.","start":117.12,"end":118.8},{"word":"Heaven","start":118.8,"end":119.44},{"word":"cast","start":119.44,"end":119.68},{"word":"them","start":119.68,"end":119.92},{"word":"out","start":119.92,"end":120.08},{"word":"to","start":120.08,"end":120.56},{"word":"preserve","start":120.56,"end":120.8},{"word":"its","start":120.8,"end":120.96},{"word":"beauty;","start":120.96,"end":122.08},{"word":"The","start":122.08,"end":122.4},{"word":"depths","start":122.4,"end":122.56},{"word":"of","start":122.56,"end":123.04},{"word":"Hell","start":123.04,"end":123.2},{"word":"won't","start":123.2,"end":123.76},{"word":"receive","start":123.76,"end":123.92},{"word":"them","start":123.92,"end":124.32},{"word":"either,","start":124.32,"end":125.04},{"word":"For","start":125.04,"end":125.28},{"word":"even","start":125.28,"end":125.52},{"word":"the","start":125.52,"end":125.84},{"word":"damned","start":125.84,"end":126.32},{"word":"would","start":126.32,"end":126.56},{"word":"gain","start":126.56,"end":126.8},{"word":"glory","start":126.8,"end":127.44},{"word":"over","start":127.44,"end":127.68},{"word":"them.","start":127.68,"end":127.92}]},{"id":10,"speaker":"dante","text":"Master,\" I said, \"what weighs so heavily on them\nThat makes them wail so desperately?","startTime":127.92,"endTime":133.68,"words":[{"word":"Master,\"","start":128.08,"end":128.96},{"word":"I","start":128.96,"end":129.24},{"word":"said,","start":129.24,"end":129.92},{"word":"\"what","start":129.92,"end":130.32},{"word":"weighs","start":130.32,"end":130.64},{"word":"so","start":130.64,"end":130.8},{"word":"heavily","start":130.8,"end":131.28},{"word":"on","start":131.28,"end":131.44},{"word":"them","start":131.44,"end":131.6},{"word":"That","start":131.6,"end":131.8},{"word":"makes","start":131.8,"end":132.04},{"word":"them","start":132.04,"end":132.2},{"word":"wail","start":132.2,"end":132.72},{"word":"so","start":132.72,"end":133},{"word":"desperately?","start":133,"end":133.68}]},{"id":11,"speaker":"narrator","text":"He replied:","startTime":133.68,"endTime":134.72,"words":[{"word":"He","start":133.761,"end":133.921},{"word":"replied:","start":133.921,"end":134.72}]},{"id":12,"speaker":"virgil","text":"I'll tell you briefly.\nThese souls no longer hope for death,\nAnd their blind life is so degraded\nThey envy every other fate.\nThe world allows no memory of them;\nBoth mercy and justice scorn them.\nLet's not speak of them—just look and pass on.","startTime":134.72,"endTime":154.08,"words":[{"word":"I'll","start":134.72,"end":134.96},{"word":"tell","start":134.96,"end":135.2},{"word":"you","start":135.2,"end":135.44},{"word":"briefly.","start":135.44,"end":136.48},{"word":"These","start":136.48,"end":136.88},{"word":"souls","start":136.88,"end":137.44},{"word":"no","start":137.44,"end":137.68},{"word":"longer","start":137.68,"end":138.16},{"word":"hope","start":138.16,"end":138.48},{"word":"for","start":138.48,"end":138.72},{"word":"death,","start":138.72,"end":139.52},{"word":"And","start":139.52,"end":139.68},{"word":"their","start":139.68,"end":139.84},{"word":"blind","start":139.84,"end":140.32},{"word":"life","start":140.32,"end":140.72},{"word":"is","start":140.72,"end":141},{"word":"so","start":141,"end":141.2},{"word":"degraded","start":141.2,"end":142.16},{"word":"They","start":142.16,"end":142.56},{"word":"envy","start":142.56,"end":143.16},{"word":"every","start":143.16,"end":143.52},{"word":"other","start":143.52,"end":143.84},{"word":"fate.","start":143.84,"end":144.8},{"word":"The","start":144.8,"end":144.96},{"word":"world","start":144.96,"end":145.52},{"word":"allows","start":145.52,"end":145.84},{"word":"no","start":145.84,"end":146.08},{"word":"memory","start":146.08,"end":146.56},{"word":"of","start":146.56,"end":146.76},{"word":"them;","start":146.76,"end":147.44},{"word":"Both","start":147.44,"end":147.76},{"word":"mercy","start":147.76,"end":148.32},{"word":"and","start":148.32,"end":148.64},{"word":"justice","start":148.64,"end":149.36},{"word":"scorn","start":149.36,"end":149.84},{"word":"them.","start":149.84,"end":150.64},{"word":"Let's","start":150.64,"end":150.96},{"word":"not","start":150.96,"end":151.12},{"word":"speak","start":151.12,"end":151.44},{"word":"of","start":151.44,"end":151.64},{"word":"them—just","start":151.64,"end":152.56},{"word":"look","start":152.56,"end":153.04},{"word":"and","start":153.04,"end":153.36},{"word":"pass","start":153.36,"end":153.6},{"word":"on.","start":153.6,"end":154.08}]},{"id":13,"speaker":"narrator","text":"Looking again, I saw a banner\nWhirling and racing forward so rapidly\nIt seemed to scorn all rest.\nBehind it came such a long procession\nOf people that I never would have believed\nDeath had undone so many.\nAfter I recognized some among them,\nI saw and knew the shadow of the one\nWho made the great refusal through cowardice.\nAt once I understood and was certain\nThis was the sect of worthless wretches\nHateful to God and to his enemies.\nThese miserable souls, who were never truly alive,\nWere naked and constantly stung\nBy wasps and hornets.\nThe insects streaked their faces with blood\nWhich, mixed with tears, fell to their feet\nWhere disgusting worms gathered it up.\nWhen I looked farther ahead,\nI saw people on the bank of a great river.","startTime":154.08,"endTime":202.88,"words":[{"word":"Looking","start":154.24,"end":154.56},{"word":"again,","start":154.56,"end":155.44},{"word":"I","start":155.44,"end":155.653},{"word":"saw","start":155.653,"end":155.84},{"word":"a","start":155.84,"end":156.24},{"word":"banner","start":156.24,"end":156.72},{"word":"Whirling","start":156.72,"end":157.28},{"word":"and","start":157.28,"end":157.44},{"word":"racing","start":157.44,"end":157.92},{"word":"forward","start":157.92,"end":158.4},{"word":"so","start":158.4,"end":158.72},{"word":"rapidly","start":158.72,"end":159.28},{"word":"It","start":159.28,"end":159.44},{"word":"seemed","start":159.44,"end":159.72},{"word":"to","start":159.72,"end":159.96},{"word":"scorn","start":159.96,"end":160.48},{"word":"all","st